</head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="legal-nav"><a href="/" class="brand"><img src="/mark.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="">MIDI Roundtrip Check</a></header><main id="main" class="legal"><p class="eyebrow">Plain-language policy</p><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Last updated 28 August 2026.</p><h2>Your music stays with you</h2><p>MIDI analysis happens entirely on your device. We do not upload, read, or retain your compositions. The desktop app has no telemetry.</p><h2>License data</h2><p>If you unlock Receipt mode, the app stores your license token and a dated verification result locally on your device. Verification sends only that token to Sociobot’s billing API. Sociobot/Dodo is the merchant of record and processes checkout data under its own policy.</p><h2>Website</h2><p>The static website sets no advertising or analytics cookies. Server hosts may retain standard security logs such as IP address and request time.</p><h2>Your control</h2><p>Remove local licenses and preferences using your browser or operating system’s application-data controls. Questions: <a href="mailto:privacy@sociobot.in">privacy@sociobot.in</a>.</p><p><a href="/">Back to the checker</a></p></main></body></html>
